        {
          "id": "69940ff18f924373ef02c96e",
          "question": "<p>In Dumas method for estimation of nitrogen \\( 0.3 \\mathrm{~g} \\) of an organic compound gave \\( 50 \\mathrm{~mL} \\) of nitrogen collected at \\( 300 \\mathrm{~K} \\) temperature and \\( 715 \\mathrm{~mm} \\) pressure. Calculate the % composition of nitrogen in the compound: (Aqueous tension at \\( 300 \\mathrm{~K}=15 \\mathrm{~mm} \\) )</p>",
          "image_url": null,
          "images": [],
          "type": "mcq",
          "options": [
            "<p>\\( 11.46 \\% \\)</p>",
            "<p>\\( 17.46 \\% \\)</p>",
            "<p>\\( 22.06 \\% \\)</p>",
            "<p>\\( 39.65 \\% \\)</p>"
          ],
          "correct": 1,
          "explanation": "<p data-start=\"74\" data-end=\"295\">Given: mass sample = 0.30 g, <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{N_2}=50</annotation></semantics></math></span></span><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0.050</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=0.050</annotation></semantics></math> </span></span>L, <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T=300</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>&nbsp;K, total <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>715</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=715</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>mm Hg, aqueous tension = 15 mm Hg &rarr; <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>715</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>700</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{N_2}=715-15=700</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>mm Hg <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>700</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>760</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=700/760</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">700/760</span></span></span></span> atm <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0.92105</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=0.92105</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>&nbsp;atm. <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.082057</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R=0.082057</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>&nbsp;L&middot;atm&middot;mol⁻&sup1;&middot;K⁻&sup1;.</p>\n<p data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"309\">Moles of N₂:</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.92105</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0.050</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.082057</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>300</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.00187076</mn><mtext>&#160;mol</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=\\dfrac{P V}{R T}=\\dfrac{0.92105\\times0.050}{0.082057\\times300}=0.00187076\\ \\text{mol}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></span></p>\n<p data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"497\">Moles of N atoms <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.00374152</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=2n=0.00374152</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>&nbsp;mol.<br data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"448\" />Mass of N <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0.00374152</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>14.007</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.052407</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=0.00374152\\times14.007=0.052407</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>&nbsp;g.</p>\n<p data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"569\">Percent N <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>0.052407</mn><mn>0.30</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>17.47</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=\\dfrac{0.052407}{0.30}\\times100=17.47\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></p>\n<p data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"594\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">&nbsp;</p>"
