          "id": "69940ff08f924373ef02c949",
          "question": "<p>A liquid compound (x) can be purified by steam distillation only if it is</p>",
          "image_url": null,
          "images": [],
          "type": "mcq",
          "options": [
            "<p>Steam volatile, immiscible with water</p>",
            "<p>Not steam volatile, miscible with water</p>",
            "<p>Steam volatile, miscible with water</p>",
            "<p>Not steam volatile, immiscible with water</p>"
          ],
          "correct": 0,
          "explanation": "<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"44\">For <strong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"26\">steam distillation</strong>, a compound must:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"142\">\n<li data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"90\">\n<p data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"90\"><strong data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"88\">Vaporise with steam (steam volatile)</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"91\" data-end=\"142\">\n<p data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"142\"><strong data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"142\">Not dissolve in water (immiscible with water)</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"144\" data-end=\"222\">This allows it to distil at a temperature lower than its normal boiling point.</p>"
